      "body": "Third quarter 2026 results: EPS: ₹338 (up from ₹21.87 in 3Q 2025). Revenue: ₹378.5m (up 262% from 3Q 2025). Net income: ₹136.6m (up ₹127.7m from 3Q 2025). Profit margin: 36% (up from 8.4% in 3Q 2025). The increase in margin was driven by higher revenue. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has increased by 12% per year but the company’s share price has increased by 27% per year, which means it is tracking significantly ahead of earnings growth.",
